            "review_title": "Review at Bach Hac Tra",
            "review_text": "SteaveKassel\n1 contribution\n0\nCozy corner in Hanoi, handmade green tea\nAug 2016 • Friends\nNice cozy corner a ☕ stop after visiting Vietnam Museum of Ethnology or working in the park. \nYou can taste many kinds of green handmade tea. There are also many traditional tea sets to buy for presenting your friends. \n Wooden interior in traditional Vietnamese style. Staff is friendly, good music in a nice sound level. \nThe food is delicious and the service is outstanding. Will definately be back next time:)\nRead more\nWritten August 31, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
